      "page": 330,
      "ruku": 284,
      "hizbQuarter": 132,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2581,
      "text": "Indeed, you and all that you worship besides Allah will be the fuel for Hell; you will surely enter it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 98,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 330,
      "ruku": 284,
      "hizbQuarter": 132,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2582,
      "text": "If these [idols] had truly been gods, they would not have entered it. But they will all abide therein forever.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 99,
